 bursts of shots at the nearest enemy", "Bracelet evolution: more bursts, each hits harder", "Bi-Bracelet evolution: bursts split on impact", "+1 revival per level", "+50% pickup range, then +25% per level", "+10% area per level", "+10% luck per level", "+10% projectile speed per level", "+10% effect duration per level", "Summons cats that roam and claw nearby enemies", "Gatti Amari evolution: cats can turn foes into gold", "Columns of light drop from the sky near you", "Mana song evolution: wider beams that slow foes", "Leaves a damaging trail as you move, bursts on stop", "Pinion evolution: a longer, bigger trail and burst", "No damage, can freeze enemies in time", "Lancet evolution: halves the health of hit enemies", "Shield blocks all damage briefly, then recharges", "Laurel evolution: caps damage taken and retaliates", "Bouncing shot, faster cooldown as you move", "Dusting evolution: bounces and chain explosions", "Fires many bouncing projectiles around the area", "Holy blasts rain down at random around you", "Grants an extra weapon draft to pick from", "Sword slashes fly at the nearest enemy", "Sweeping cones of flame from your position", "Flames evolution: grows with every enemy killed", "Retaliates with an attack when you are hurt", "Pako evolution: damage and amount scale with max health", "Fires forward and stockpiles shots until enemies appear", "Ammo evolution: fires at any enemy in line of sight", "Crits by any weapon leave damage zones", "Bolt evolution: zones always deal critical hits", "Aimed shot; scales with Speed, hits frozen foes harder", "Fandango evolution: crits and freezes what it hits", "Tuna weapon: gains a random tuna form each level", "Tuna form: speed-focused upgrades", "Tuna form: duration-focused upgrades", "Tuna form: cooldown-focused upgrades", "Tuna form: amount-focused upgrades", "Tuna form: area-focused upgrades", "Tuna form: might-focused upgrades", "Tuna finale: all tuna forms fire at once", "Throws javelins that can crit", "Jav